MAIN
MOVE TEMP 12 4
MOVE TEMP 13 HALLOCATE TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 4
MOVE TEMP 15 HALLOCATE TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 TEMP 1
