MOVE TEMP 17 IfTest_ved_TestIf
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 17
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 18 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 18
PRINT TEMP 4
END
IfTest_ved_TestIf [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 19 0
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 20 5
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 10
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 LE TEMP 3 TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 22
CJUMP TEMP 5 L1
MOVE TEMP 23 100
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 6
L1  NOOP
PRINT TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 24 10
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 5
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 26 LE TEMP 7 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 26
CJUMP TEMP 9 L2
MOVE TEMP 27 200
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 27
